msgstr "An option for separately specifying actions for records is also available:"

#: ../../settings_kb/ui_actions.rst:173
msgid "Фронтенд"
msgstr "Frontend"

#: ../../settings_kb/ui_actions.rst:175
msgid ""
"На фронтенде действия описаны в виде javascript сущностей с методами "
"``execForRecord``, ``execForRecords``, ``execForQuery``, "
"``getDefaultModel``, ``canBeExecuted`` и др."
msgstr ""
"On the frontend, actions are described as JavaScript entities with "
"methods ``execForRecord``, ``execForRecords``, ``execForQuery``, "
"``getDefaultModel``, ``canBeExecuted``, etc."

#: ../../settings_kb/ui_actions.rst:177
msgid ""
"Например: "
"``src/components/Records/actions/handler/executor/CreateAction.js``"
msgstr ""
"For example: "
"``src/components/Records/actions/handler/executor/CreateAction.js``"

#: ../../settings_kb/ui_actions.rst:179
msgid ""
"При выполнении действия вызывается метод execute в который передается "
"запись, над которой выполняется действие и конфигурация действия."
msgstr ""
"When an action is executed, the execute method is called, which receives "
"the record on which the action is performed and the action configuration."

#: ../../settings_kb/ui_actions.rst:181
msgid ""
"Реестр действий описан в "
"``src/components/Records/actions/RecordActionExecutorsRegistry.js``"
msgstr ""
"The action registry is described in "
"``src/components/Records/actions/RecordActionExecutorsRegistry.js``"

#: ../../settings_kb/ui_actions.rst:183
msgid ""
"Регистрация действий в реестре: "
"``src/components/Records/actions/index.js``"
msgstr ""
"Action registration in the registry: "
"``src/components/Records/actions/index.js``"

